+/*
+ * rtw_is_wmmps_mode
+ * This function is used for checking whether Driver and an AP support uapsd function or not.
+ * If both of them support uapsd function, it will return true. Otherwise returns false.
+ * 
+ * Arguments:
+ * @padapter: _adapter pointer.
